  "actual_interactions": [
    "Inspected main/pause menus, wheel setup with no device, 150% text at 1440x900 and 1100x700, and the fixed Controls footer.",
    "Used the on-screen keyboard to apply Mira, then reopened it, added a character and discarded the draft without changing the applied name. This used native mouse/keyboard; gamepad button navigation is covered by virtual tests.",
    "Created Mira Vale and Greenhaven Roads, selected the authored Heightmap valley at GPS 48.137,11.575, radius 3 (49 chunks), seed 42, balanced graphics, one-times clock and regional SQLite storage.",
    "Paused the simulation for deterministic transactions. Rented a Comet hatchback for 1.80 credits plus 15.00 for 10 litres of finite fuel and a 45.00 bond; renewed for 1.80, preserving 600 physical seconds while paused.",
    "Registered Greenhaven Transit for 20 personal credits, deposited 50, opened a 25-company-credit depot at Roadside garage, stored four wood and hired Eli Stone for 10 company credits.",
    "Bought bread and water for a combined 3.30 credits from the actual market. Full-needs consumption actions were correctly disabled; consumption is not claimed from this interaction.",
    "Claimed a 40-metre housing plot, gathered five wood and five stone, and founded Greenhaven neighborhood using 20 wood, 10 stone and 50 credits.",
    "Crafted building materials, placed a house and workbench, planted one wheat seed, and set the house as home through the real UI.",
    "Saved and returned to the menu, then quit and restarted the final binary. Global state, regional records and metadata matched the previous checkpoint exactly before resuming.",
    "Confirmed the final terrain-draped plot ring, readable enlarged inspector/Fleet tabs, and adjacent rental chooser. Returned the selected rental at the original garage after confirming the 60-credit quote.",
    "The rental return restored ten litres to the garage and refunded the 45-credit escrow plus 15-credit fuel payment. Company, depot and carried inventory were unchanged.",
    "Withdrew one wood from the persisted depot: carried stock 3 to 4, depot stock 4 to 3, with no money change.",
    "Used session Controls to change text from saved 150% to unsaved 100%, entered the owned pickup, drove with keyboard pedals, switched chase/cockpit with C, engaged P parking brake, released possession with F1, paused the RTS clock and checkpointed.",
    "Save and quit committed exact global, regional and metadata state. No game processes remained; the owned virtual display was stopped. Saved controls retained 150% because the session-only change was not explicitly saved."
  ],
